#: ../../source/generated/cuda.tile.extract.rst:2
msgid "cuda.tile.extract"
msgstr "cuda.tile.extract"

#: cuda.tile._stub.extract:1 of
msgid "Extracts a smaller tile from input tile."
msgstr "从输入 Tile 中提取一个较小的子 Tile。"

#: cuda.tile._stub.extract:3 of
msgid ""
"Partition the input tile into a grid with subtile shape and return a tile"
" given the index into the grid. Similar to :py:func:`load` but performed "
"on a tile."
msgstr ""
"按子 Tile 形状将输入 Tile 划分为网格，并根据网格索引返回对应的子 Tile。功能类似于 :py:func:`load` ，但直接作用于"
" Tile。"

#: ../../source/generated/cuda.tile.extract.rst
msgid "Parameters"
msgstr "参数"

#: cuda.tile._stub.extract:7 of
msgid "input tile."
msgstr "输入 Tile。"

#: cuda.tile._stub.extract:9 of
msgid ""
"Index into the grid of subtiles, not element index. Each dimension ``i`` "
"has ``x.shape[i] // shape[i]`` subtiles; valid values are ``[0, "
"x.shape[i] // shape[i])``. For example, extracting shape ``(4,)`` from a "
"``(128,)`` tile gives 32 subtiles, so valid indices are 0–31."
msgstr ""
"子 Tile 网格中的索引（而非元素级索引）。每个维度 ``i`` 包含 ``x.shape[i] // shape[i]`` 个子 "
"Tile；有效索引范围为 ``[0, x.shape[i] // shape[i])`` 。例如，从形状为 ``(128,)`` 的 Tile "
"中提取形状为 ``(4,)`` 的子 Tile 会划分出 32 个子 Tile，因此有效索引为 0–31。"

#: cuda.tile._stub.extract:15 of
msgid ""
"The shape of the extracted tile. Must evenly divide ``x.shape`` in every "
"dimension."
msgstr "所提取子 Tile 的形状。必须在每个维度上都能整除 ``x.shape`` 。"

#: ../../source/generated/cuda.tile.extract.rst
msgid "Return type"
msgstr "返回类型"

#: cuda.tile._stub.extract:22 of
msgid "Examples"
msgstr "示例"

#: cuda.tile._stub.extract:23 of
msgid "1D tile."
msgstr "一维 Tile。"

#: cuda.tile._stub.extract:38 cuda.tile._stub.extract:53 of
msgid "Output"
msgstr "输出"

#: cuda.tile._stub.extract:39 of
msgid "2D tile."
msgstr "二维 Tile。"

